msgid "Compassion knows that children living in extreme\n"
"                                        poverty are vulnerable.\n"
"                                        We put their protection as our number one priority.\n"
"                                        We ask our volunteering\n"
"                                        friends and people that travel to visit their\n"
"                                        sponsored child to sign a\n"
"                                        child protection charter. If you want to make a step\n"
"                                        further, you can sign\n"
"                                        this document as well and show us that you share our\n"
"                                        values.\n"
"                                        <br/>\n"
"                                        Compassion is\n"
"                                        also serious about the protection of your data. All\n"
"                                        your information is kept private and only used\n"
"                                        internally. You can sign or review our data\n"
"                                        protection policy from here."
msgstr "Compassion ved, at børn, der lever i ekstrem\n"
"                                        fattigdom, er sårbare.\n"
"                                        Deres beskyttelse er vores højeste prioritet.\n"
"                                        Vi beder vores frivillige\n"
"                                        venner og folk, der rejser ud for at besøge deres\n"
"                                        fadderbarn, om at underskrive en\n"
"                                        børnebeskyttelseserklæring. Hvis du vil gå et skridt\n"
"                                        videre, kan du også underskrive\n"
"                                        dette dokument og vise os, at du deler vores\n"
"                                        værdier.\n"
"                                        <br/>\n"
"                                        Compassion tager\n"
"                                        også beskyttelsen af dine data alvorligt. Alle\n"
"                                        dine oplysninger holdes fortrolige og bruges kun\n"
"                                        internt. Du kan underskrive eller gennemgå vores\n"
"                                        databeskyttelsespolitik herfra."

