"The selected payment method cannot be saved for monthly payments. Please pay"
" by card."
msgstr "Den valgte betalingsmetode kan ikke gemmes til månedlige betalinger. Betal venligst med kort."

#. module: my_compassion
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/my_compassion/controllers/my2_update_card.py:0
