msgstr "Udbyderen rapporterede aldrig resultatet af denne betaling. Den opgives efter %s dage."

#. module: my_compassion
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:my_compassion.field_recurring_contract__my2_signup
msgid "The sponsorship was created by the sponsor through the MyCompassion signup wizard. Such sponsors are invited to create their portal account once the sponsorship is confirmed."
msgstr "Fadderskabet blev oprettet af fadderen via MyCompassion-guiden. Sådanne faddere inviteres til at oprette deres portalkonto, når fadderskabet er bekræftet."

#. module: my_compassion
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/my_compassion/models/contracts.py:0
msgid "The sponsor's saved card could not be charged and both fix-it emails were sent without effect. Please contact the sponsor or handle the arrears manually."
msgstr "Fadderens gemte kort kunne ikke debiteres, og begge rykkermails blev sendt uden resultat. Kontakt fadderen eller håndtér restancen manuelt."

#. module: my_compassion
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/my_compassion/models/move.py:0
msgid "This invoice cannot be charged: a payment is already open or done, or no valid saved card is available."
msgstr "Denne faktura kan ikke debiteres. En betaling er allerede åben eller gennemført, eller der findes intet gyldigt gemt kort."
